 "raw_output": "Tesla's gross profit fell about 1.6% from fiscal Q1 2023 to fiscal Q4 2023.\n\n- **Q1 2023 gross profit:** $4,511 million, from the Q1 2024 10-Q's prior-year column.\n- **Q4 2023 gross profit:** the filings do not report it directly, so I derived it from the full-year 2023 figure ($17,660 million) less the nine-month 2023 figure ($13,222 million), which gives $4,438 million.\n- **Change:** (4,438 \u2212 4,511) / 4,511 = \u221273 / 4,511 \u2248 \u22121.62%.\n\n{\"value\": -1.62, \"unit\": \"percent\", \"choice\": null, \"status\": \"answered\"}",
